  "copilot_10point_fixes_incorporated": [
    "1. Added .github/workflows/ci.yml automated GitHub Actions CI matrix (gcc & clang on ubuntu-latest)",
    "2. Separated portable default C99 flags from strict maintainer flags (STRICT_WARNINGS ?= 0) in Makefile",
    "3. Gated nonstandard wild linker behind explicit opt-in USE_WILD_LINKER ?= 0 with clear error reporting",
    "4. Added #if DOS_PLATFORM_POSIX / ISO C clock() fallbacks and macOS/BSD socket prefix support",
    "5. Added --mode portable (CI/containers) vs. --mode strict (bare-metal RT) in verify_dandelion_os_v2.8.0.py",
    "6. Centralized all magic numbers, hash seeds, socket prefixes, and 9-Bite inodes into dandelion_os_v2.8.0.h",
    "7. Directed compiled binary output exclusively into ./build/ (removed root binary pollution) and updated .gitignore",
    "8. Added Supported Environments & Toolchain Reproducibility Matrix in README.md",
    "9. Added Verified Behavior vs. Experimental & Hardware-Specific Scope and Known Limitations sections in README.md",
    "10. Added explicit requirements.txt pinning numpy and matplotlib versions"
